   rationale=f"The current-state brief describes Echelon Foundry, LLC as an Indiana LLC under formation/administration. The formation values file ({ENTV}) leaves principal office, registered agent, members, management form and federal tax treatment as TODO. No filed articles, certificate of existence or EIN record was located.",
