   current="Unknown; no evidence located that the entity has been filed or is in good standing. Formation decisions remain TODO in the formation values file.",
   intended="Complete formation, render the Indiana LLC formation packet with no TODO tokens, obtain EIN, and keep an entity facts record with a quarterly good-standing refresh.",
